    /// <example>
    /// <para>
    /// To update a Lambda function's code
    /// </para>
    /// <para>
    /// The following example replaces the code of the unpublished ($LATEST) version of a function named my-function with the contents of the specified zip file in Amazon S3.
    /// </para>
